  "question": {
    "text": "The wavelength of the radiation emitted, when in hydrogen atom electron falls from infinity to stationary state 1 , would be (Rydberg constant $\\left.=1.097 \\times 10^7 \\mathrm{~m}^{-1}\\right)$",
    "image": null
